WEBVTT

00:07.520 --> 00:14.200
Shiho Elis is on her way towards unlocking her true power, as expected.

00:15.470 --> 00:22.510
Yes, everything is going according to your order, Geizer, our god.

00:28.570 --> 00:31.530
When the red moon rises up in the sky,

00:32.310 --> 00:37.050
the dark tribe, the Emulators, will come and invade the earth.

00:37.790 --> 00:43.270
They are not affected by the human knowledge of science.

00:45.980 --> 00:48.720
The only forces that go against the darkness,

00:48.720 --> 00:51.110
are the ones long forgotten by humans.

00:51.110 --> 00:54.570
The ones who utilize magic to fight.

00:55.860 --> 00:58.940
They are called the Magicians of the Night,

01:00.540 --> 01:02.950
the Night Wizard.

02:47.810 --> 02:49.140
TUMBLING DOWN!

03:21.430 --> 03:22.090
Get down.

03:24.510 --> 03:25.800
Just get down.

03:32.520 --> 03:33.310
I missed.

03:37.860 --> 03:38.610
You!

03:53.020 --> 03:55.830
Looks like we got them all.

03:55.830 --> 03:58.920
We're all saved thanks to Akari coming here.

04:00.130 --> 04:06.270
Oji-sama, the new member of our party, Akari-san, is a strong and cool girl.

04:06.930 --> 04:11.050
Umm, I'm sorry for getting in your way.

04:11.050 --> 04:12.100
Thank you.

04:16.900 --> 04:21.400
But, it seems like she hates me.

04:27.540 --> 04:30.020
They're quite good.

04:30.020 --> 04:33.870
So it's an easy win for them if it's just Golems, huh?

04:34.240 --> 04:42.760
Bell-sama said that I could either kill that girl or take the jewel, but...

04:44.260 --> 04:47.470
I'm a greedy girl.

04:50.620 --> 04:53.810
The jewel is in this temple-like building?

04:53.810 --> 04:57.240
Yes, I can feel its presence coming from the top floor.

04:57.240 --> 05:00.000
If Elis said that, then there's no doubt about it.

05:04.440 --> 05:06.260
Elis-chan, is something wrong?

05:06.260 --> 05:09.910
Eh, no, it's nothing.

05:19.170 --> 05:20.800
Don't let your guard down.

05:20.800 --> 05:23.750
We don't know what kind of traps there are in this plac-!

05:24.320 --> 05:25.090
Hiiragi!

05:33.990 --> 05:34.980
Hiiragi-senpai!

05:38.230 --> 05:41.270
We definitely need to be careful with the traps.

05:41.270 --> 05:45.420
Elis-chan, you musn't wander around or touch anything in here.

05:45.420 --> 05:46.100
Okay.

05:46.100 --> 05:49.940
If you want to touch something, you should let Hiiragi try it out first.

05:49.940 --> 05:51.660
You're sacrificing me?!

06:04.260 --> 06:05.300
Okay then.

06:07.470 --> 06:08.680
Hiiragi-senpai!

06:08.680 --> 06:10.020
Are you all right?

06:17.310 --> 06:18.660
Hiiragi-senpai!

06:18.660 --> 06:20.270
That's scary!

06:21.560 --> 06:23.140
Hiiragi-senpai!

06:23.140 --> 06:24.270
We'll go on ahead!

06:25.500 --> 06:26.800
Hiiragi-senpai...

06:26.800 --> 06:28.010
Good work...

06:42.390 --> 06:45.500
Thanks to you, we managed to proceed smoothly.

06:45.500 --> 06:48.480
Let me give you the title of "trap sensor".

06:48.480 --> 06:49.720
Who needs that?!

06:52.750 --> 06:55.810
Mind your manners, Hiiragi.

06:55.810 --> 06:59.660
If it's okay, how about we take a short break?

06:59.660 --> 07:03.020
I brought several things along with me inside my Kaguya.

07:03.780 --> 07:07.480
Ah, you've come well prepared, Elis-chan!

07:07.480 --> 07:11.420
This is all that I can do.

07:11.420 --> 07:13.100
Itadakima~su!

07:13.100 --> 07:14.650
You even brought hot towels.

07:14.650 --> 07:16.010
It was very considerate of you.

07:16.010 --> 07:17.540
Itadakimasu!

07:22.620 --> 07:24.000
Excuse me.

07:26.310 --> 07:27.880
Would you like some tea?

07:30.530 --> 07:31.970
Thank you.

07:32.770 --> 07:37.350
Akari-san, you're a student in Kimei Academy's 2nd year class 3, right?

07:37.350 --> 07:42.000
I am in the same class; I just transferred there recently.

07:42.000 --> 07:44.000
Nice to meet you.

07:44.740 --> 07:48.070
Would you like a madeleine with your tea?

07:48.070 --> 07:51.250
You don't have to be so anxious.

07:51.250 --> 07:54.640
It is my mission to protect you.

08:00.490 --> 08:04.960
Ah, Elis-chan, this madeleine is really moist and delicious!

08:05.250 --> 08:06.710
You think so?

08:06.710 --> 08:10.760
Then, I'll bring them to Anzelotte-san the next time we meet.

08:10.760 --> 08:14.050
Huh? You don't have to care for that girl.

08:14.050 --> 08:19.010
She treats people badly; she's just another old hag trying to look young.

08:20.850 --> 08:26.360
It felt like Hiiragi-san was bad-mouthing me just now.

08:26.770 --> 08:31.320
If that's true, then just like magic, a judgment from heaven shall befall him.

08:31.320 --> 08:35.990
It's still safe to eat if it's under 3 seconds.

08:40.150 --> 08:42.280
That... basin...

08:42.280 --> 08:44.000
It's a classic trap.

08:44.000 --> 08:47.170
Magallanica civilization is scary.

09:07.180 --> 09:08.730
Is something wrong?

09:09.510 --> 09:11.260
Akari-san...

09:11.260 --> 09:13.780
I'm sorry, I'm just weak.

09:16.610 --> 09:18.990
Elis-chan, hurry up and come over here!

09:18.990 --> 09:21.450
Okay, excuse me.

09:26.760 --> 09:30.840
That Elis kid is such a burden.

09:30.840 --> 09:35.220
Too bad, but the jewel will be mine.

09:59.540 --> 10:02.620
What... is this powerful barrier?!

10:14.010 --> 10:15.680
Something was shining over there.

10:31.100 --> 10:32.780
Wall paintings?

10:32.780 --> 10:36.240
An orange and green jewel!

10:36.790 --> 10:39.910
These were the jewels that were shining just now.

10:51.630 --> 10:53.270
Syai...maar?

10:54.260 --> 10:55.760
Elis-chan, you can read them?

10:56.780 --> 10:59.720
Huh? No, somehow...

10:59.720 --> 11:01.670
Syaimaar?

11:01.670 --> 11:03.480
I think I've heard that name before.

11:03.480 --> 11:08.730
Syaimaar is a Greater Devil who ruled over Rikai a long long time ago.

11:09.090 --> 11:16.360
Then... this painting depicts what Anzelotte-san said about the war between the Emulators and the Wizards?

11:16.360 --> 11:17.780
Seems like it.

11:18.260 --> 11:22.160
It was a long time ago, which means it was never finished.

11:25.120 --> 11:31.010
In order to end that war, we must find all the jewels.

11:59.640 --> 12:02.610
Huh?! A dead end?!

12:02.610 --> 12:05.770
What should we do? Turn back? Elis!

12:06.240 --> 12:07.470
Elis-chan?!

12:09.410 --> 12:11.230
What's wrong, Elis-chan?

12:11.230 --> 12:13.260
I-I'm all right.

12:13.260 --> 12:15.480
That's not an "all right" face.

12:15.480 --> 12:16.470
Is it a headache?

12:16.470 --> 12:18.490
Could you have been enduring it all this time?

12:18.490 --> 12:20.740
You don't have to worry about it.

12:20.740 --> 12:25.300
I think this is a reaction to the jewel.

12:25.300 --> 12:31.480
I felt the same way when I felt the first jewel at Kimei Academy.

12:31.480 --> 12:33.320
Let's move on.

12:33.320 --> 12:36.410
The jewel should be somewhere near.

12:36.410 --> 12:37.820
But even if you say that...

12:37.820 --> 12:39.570
I am fine.

12:41.860 --> 12:44.860
Try touching the Jewel of Kindness.

12:45.910 --> 12:51.760
Anzelotte said that the Jewel of Kindness also possesses the power of healing.

13:09.400 --> 13:10.650
Amazing.

13:10.650 --> 13:13.000
I can't believe how great I'm feeling right now.

13:13.000 --> 13:14.810
Thank you, Akari-san.

13:15.660 --> 13:19.240
That Anzelotte sometimes does say something worthwhile.

13:19.240 --> 13:21.790
Let's search for the route to the jewel.

13:21.790 --> 13:24.830
It should definitely be somewhere in this room.

13:24.830 --> 13:25.900
You're right.

13:25.900 --> 13:29.000
Come on, Hiiragi. Stop daydreaming.

13:29.000 --> 13:30.370
Shut up will you? Geez.

13:40.590 --> 13:44.550
It's no good, I couldn't find any door or hole.

13:44.550 --> 13:47.800
Geez, such a troublesome piece of work...

13:49.020 --> 13:50.420
What's this?!

13:52.510 --> 13:57.680
I get it, Hiiragi is working as a weight to carry us up!

13:57.680 --> 13:59.150
I think this is the way.

13:59.150 --> 14:04.640
Hey you three, quit talking and get me out...

14:00.000 --> 14:02.000
But Hiiragi-senpai is...

14:02.000 --> 14:04.640
He'll be fine, don't worry.

14:04.640 --> 14:09.370
Hiiragi Renji, that "dropped student" title isn't just for show.

14:22.500 --> 14:23.750
I can feel it.

14:23.750 --> 14:25.640
The jewel is near.

14:25.640 --> 14:27.550
Okay then, let's go.

14:37.650 --> 14:39.350
Something's shining.

14:39.350 --> 14:40.770
Another wall painting?

14:40.770 --> 14:45.780
But that... looks like it's moving.

14:53.780 --> 14:55.950
Elis-chan, look over there!

14:58.000 --> 14:59.420
It's the jewel!

15:01.610 --> 15:03.850
Elis-chan, be careful.

15:03.850 --> 15:04.920
Okay.

15:15.640 --> 15:16.780
Are you okay?!

15:16.780 --> 15:17.850
A barrier?!

15:18.270 --> 15:19.530
How can that be?!

15:19.530 --> 15:22.860
It's right in front of our very eyes, yet we can't take it...

15:24.020 --> 15:30.190
What's this? Looks like that girl doesn't have the power to break the barrier.

15:30.190 --> 15:32.950
Go ahead and die then.

15:44.700 --> 15:47.270
It was normal armor just a minute ago.

15:48.660 --> 15:52.240
We'll take care of the armors, Elis-chan, stay back!

15:52.240 --> 15:53.300
Y-Yes.

16:00.310 --> 16:02.730
How can I get the jewel?

16:02.730 --> 16:04.690
There's definitely a way.

16:05.760 --> 16:06.650
Flame?

16:08.720 --> 16:10.360
The two flames...

16:10.360 --> 16:13.750
I think I saw something similar to this just now...

16:17.010 --> 16:21.010
The orange and green jewel embedded on the wall painting.

16:21.010 --> 16:25.810
It looks like a torch carried by the ancient Wizards.

16:26.500 --> 16:28.630
Torch... flame...

16:28.630 --> 16:31.050
A green and orange flame...

16:31.810 --> 16:33.250
Could it be...?

16:41.960 --> 16:44.000
E-Elis-chan?!

16:44.000 --> 16:48.230
What kind of Wizard studies during a battle?!

16:48.230 --> 16:49.230
This is it!

16:50.010 --> 16:55.740
When melted under high temperatures, the electrons within the atoms of the metal will...

17:02.870 --> 17:03.620
Oh no!

17:07.190 --> 17:10.000
Goodbye, Elis-chan.

17:15.560 --> 17:16.550
Hiiragi-senpai!

17:22.590 --> 17:24.690
Hiiragi Renji is here!

17:25.490 --> 17:27.690
Sorry for being late.

17:27.690 --> 17:31.400
I'm not sure whether to call this being late or not.

17:31.790 --> 17:34.750
Hiiragi Renji, why did you come from above?

17:34.750 --> 17:37.410
How the hell would I know? Go ask the bastard who created this dungeon!

17:37.410 --> 17:41.540
Geez, you're just too jinxed.

17:42.000 --> 17:44.620
Well, we finished off all those armors pretty quickly.

17:45.020 --> 17:49.210
Perhaps we can break the barrier by surrounding the jewel.

17:49.210 --> 17:50.250
Huh?

17:54.620 --> 17:56.300
Flame test?

17:56.300 --> 17:59.780
Yes. We learned about it in Chemistry class.

17:59.780 --> 18:01.970
I have salt with me, but...

18:02.540 --> 18:03.740
Salt?

18:03.740 --> 18:05.560
It's just that I don't have copper...

18:05.560 --> 18:08.680
Does anyone have something with copper wire in it?

18:08.680 --> 18:09.400
Copper?

18:10.340 --> 18:12.120
Earphone cord.

18:13.010 --> 18:15.070
It should have copper wire inside.

18:16.550 --> 18:17.960
Thank you!

18:23.560 --> 18:25.260
The color changed!

18:33.330 --> 18:35.480
A green and orange flame...

18:35.480 --> 18:38.250
Now it looks like what was shown on the wall painting.

18:43.560 --> 18:47.000
My light, come back to me.

19:00.200 --> 19:01.500
We did it!

19:02.020 --> 19:04.900
This seems to be the Jewel of Wisdom.

19:04.900 --> 19:06.430
Elis, you can tell what it is?

19:06.430 --> 19:09.770
Yes, my bracelet told me so.

19:13.570 --> 19:16.550
That was very good, Shiho Elis-chan.

19:16.550 --> 19:22.650
Thanks to you, I can get what Bell-sama wishes for.

19:22.650 --> 19:25.720
Both the jewel, and your life.

19:30.260 --> 19:33.520
I think Bell-sama is going to be very pleased to see this.

19:33.520 --> 19:34.720
Why you?!

19:34.720 --> 19:36.350
Elis-chan, be careful!

19:36.350 --> 19:37.030
Yes!

19:41.840 --> 19:44.490
Your toy seems to be quite powerful.

19:45.000 --> 19:46.390
Looks interesting.

19:46.390 --> 19:48.500
Let us play for a bit, shall we?

19:49.540 --> 19:52.840
I'll steal you.

19:54.590 --> 19:58.920
I am the earl of thievery and destruction, Larlam.

19:58.920 --> 20:03.470
How do you feel about being killed by yourself?

20:05.780 --> 20:07.430
There are two Akarins?!

20:07.430 --> 20:10.000
Which one is the real one?!

20:10.000 --> 20:12.900
Damn, is there no way to distinguish them?!

20:12.900 --> 20:16.610
A way to distinguish who the real Akari-san is...

20:19.650 --> 20:23.320
Kureha-san, can you attack both of them simultaneously?

20:24.320 --> 20:26.080
I can, but why?

20:26.080 --> 20:29.790
To tell you the truth, I really hate Akari-san.

20:30.840 --> 20:33.460
Let's use this chance to kill both of them!

20:35.330 --> 20:37.630
Nice idea there Elis-chan.

20:38.180 --> 20:41.380
I myself want to kick Akarin's ass for once.

20:42.580 --> 20:45.590
Akarin, prepare yourself!!

20:56.110 --> 20:57.610
The one on the right is the duplicate!

20:58.440 --> 21:00.280
You don't have to tell me that!

21:01.290 --> 21:05.950
I'll kick you back to Rikai just like every other devil!

21:10.430 --> 21:14.420
All you stole from me was my appearance.

21:14.420 --> 21:18.130
You could never steal my heart who believes in my friends.

21:18.130 --> 21:21.800
Bell-sama!!

21:23.630 --> 21:30.000
Oh my, that Larlam was just all talk.

21:30.000 --> 21:36.100
But still, the outcome was just as it's written in this book.

21:36.100 --> 21:37.980
Tell me about it earlier will you?

21:38.360 --> 21:43.520
But that Elis kid... is even more obstinate than we had imagined.

21:43.520 --> 21:46.550
There are still five jewels left.

21:46.550 --> 21:49.450
Looks like I can have some fun with her for the time being.

22:01.010 --> 22:03.270
Umm, Akari-san...

22:04.590 --> 22:08.590
I'm sorry for saying that I hated you back there.

22:08.590 --> 22:12.320
To tell you the truth, that was all just... a tactic...

22:13.460 --> 22:14.760
I'm hungry.

22:15.700 --> 22:18.350
Are there any madeleines left?

22:25.020 --> 22:28.070
Don't worry, I brought plenty with me.

22:29.780 --> 22:31.050
Please take it.

22:31.050 --> 22:34.240
I can't finish that many.

22:34.240 --> 22:38.000
Can I call you Akari-chan from now on?

22:38.000 --> 22:39.580
Since we're both the same age.

22:39.580 --> 22:40.600
I can't?

22:40.600 --> 22:43.210
Not really.

22:55.460 --> 22:56.410
Elis-chan?!

22:56.410 --> 22:57.560
Are you all right?!

23:00.140 --> 23:02.580
My... light...

23:06.200 --> 23:07.950
is there.

24:51.300 --> 24:55.840
Oji-sama, Oji-sama! I went on a trip into space.

24:56.330 --> 25:02.480
I met a strange boy thanks to those rabbits' attacks.

25:02.480 --> 25:06.190
Hiiragi-senpai, just exactly who is he?

25:06.570 --> 25:11.190
Next time on Night Wizard THE ANIMATION, Kirihito, Meeting on the Moon's Surface.

25:12.260 --> 25:14.420
That kid really pisses me off!
